      "title": "Inference: evaluate the high-noise specialist",
      "explanation": "Inference starts from the pure-noise sampler state z0 and retains the condition x. The supervised target and local training pair are unavailable in this phase. Select Bhi from the current noise region, read z0, and obtain its symbolic denoising estimate Dhi. This is a new use of the trained specialists, not a continuation that feeds the clean training target into generation.",
