    {
      "title": "Inference: update the persistent state",
      "explanation": "The numerical sampler combines the current state, the selected specialist’s estimate, and the signed noise-level step to obtain z1. The sampler object persists; its state changes from z0 to z1. The estimate is symbolic because its actual value comes from the trained network. A specialist may serve several numerical steps while their noise levels remain in its assigned region.",
