    {
      "title": "Inference: cross into the next noise region",
      "explanation": "At the illustrated handoff, the current state is still z1 but the selected specialist changes to Blo. Blo reads that state with the same condition x and produces Dlo. Overlapping training intervals give neighboring specialists experience near the boundary; inference still selects the relevant block for the current region. Block count and numerical-step count are separate choices.",
